09-20 18:02:33.606 11032 11032 E flutter : [ERROR:flutter/runtime/dart_vm_initializer.cc(40)] Unhandled Exception: [core/no-app] No Firebase App '[DEFAULT]' has been created - call Firebase.initializeApp()
09-20 18:02:33.606 11032 11032 E flutter : #3      AuthRepository.updateToken (package:nears/features/auth/domain/repositories/auth_repository.dart:321:27)
09-20 18:02:33.606 11032 11032 E flutter : #4      AuthService._updateHeaderFunctionality (package:nears/features/auth/domain/services/auth_service.dart:55:7)
09-20 18:02:33.606 11032 11032 E flutter : #5      AuthService.login (package:nears/features/auth/domain/services/auth_service.dart:44:7)
09-20 18:02:33.606 11032 11032 E flutter : #6      AuthController.login (package:nears/features/auth/controllers/auth_controller.dart:116:37)

Not caused by NEARS-3630: auth_repository.dart / auth_service.dart /
auth_controller.dart are byte-unchanged by this ticket's commit range (last
touched by NEARS-3639/3656/3477/3103, none of which are this ticket). Filed
as a regression_bug (pre-existing, environment-config-caused, Firebase not
provisioned in this dev environment), does not affect this ticket's
PASS/FAIL verdict. Worked around for the QA point itself by relying on the
automated widget-test coverage (menu_screen_reskin_test.dart's QA-1 group,
2/2 passing) for the real-photo gating confirmation, per this delta re-QA's
own escape-hatch instruction.
